    {
      "id": "topology-exploration-11s0",
      "contribution_id": "evaluation",
      "statement": "The frozen topology-preserving exploration matrix exploration_topology_11s0 (4 methods x 11 scenes x seed 0 = 44 A100 jobs) executed end-to-end with zero failed or missing jobs. Under the pre-registered seed-0 gates, the plain official 27k-step gsplat early-stop control passes all gates (PSNR paired-delta 95% CI lower -0.092 >= -0.10 dB; SSIM lower -0.0017 >= -0.003; LPIPS upper +0.0039 <= +0.005; wall speedup-ratio mean 1.120 >= 1.111 with ratio CI lower 1.067 > 1.0; TTQ faster), while every HiGS candidate fails the quality non-inferiority margins: higs_visible_27k PSNR CI [-0.275, +0.022], higs_topology_27k PSNR CI [-1.462, -0.034], higs_topology_30k PSNR CI [-0.925, -0.030]. The observed 27k acceleration is therefore attributable to ordinary early-stop, not to the HiGS mechanisms (visible/selective Adam, cached low-resolution window, full-resolution densification anchors); no HiGS candidate qualifies for a confirmatory matrix.",
